course: dictionary
lesson: 6299
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Mop can be a thing or an action. Context tells you which one. In «Leo let the bath overflow while he played a game, mopped it with towels and hid them», mopped is an action: Leo wiped up the water.
explain: The phrase «mops it up» in the housefly sentence means cleans up a liquid. Try the swap test: put in «wipes up» and the sentence still makes sense, so your meaning is right.
explain: A mop can also be hair. «A mop of curly hair» means a thick, messy lot of hair. The word curly and the word hair are the clues, so it is not a cleaning tool.
explain: When a word has more than one meaning, read the words around it, then ask: which meaning fits here? If you are not sure, a dictionary will settle it.
fact: Mop can be a noun (a cleaning tool, or a thick, messy lot of hair) or a verb (to clean with a mop or cloth).
fact: «Mop up» means to clean up liquid, or to finish dealing with something.
fact: «Mop your brow» means wipe your forehead, usually because of sweat.
fact: A «wet floor» sign warns people after the floor has been mopped.
fact: Phrases such as «mop and bucket» and «a mop of hair» show the two common meanings of mop.
exercise: Leo mopped the bath with towels. What does mopped mean here? | *Wiped up water | Filled with bubbles | Let it overflow | Played a game
exercise: In «a mop of curly hair», what is a mop? | A bucket of soapy water | A type of towel | *A thick, messy lot of hair | A cleaning tool with a long handle
exercise: In the housefly sentence, «mops it up» means: | Throws the food away | Makes the liquid bigger | *Cleans up the liquid | Freezes the liquid
test: Find the phrase in the housefly sentence that means clean up liquid. | hard to swat | covers food | *mops it up | turn food to liquid
test: In «mop the floor», which part of speech is mop? | adjective | adverb | *verb | noun
exam: In «a mop and bucket», what does mop mean? | To dance around | A loud noise | *A cleaning tool with a long handle | A kind of food
